{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.KZ.BlockResidues","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.KZ.BlockResidues","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.KZ.NonResonantInt","lean:module:QOU.KZ.KZShiftPhi","lean:module:QOU.KZ.GLnKZ","lean:module:QOU.KZ.KZHexagonCentral"],"declarations":43,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.BlockResidues.hexagon_blocks","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.BlockResidues.hexagon_blocks","kind":"theorem","line":261,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/BlockResidues.lean#L261-L307","doc":"**The central hexagon for three disjoint blocks**, `ℏ` transcendental. With\n`t_{ab} = t_{X_a, X_b}` and `T = t₁₂ + t₂₃ + t₁₃`:\n`e^{−iπℏt₁₂} Φ(ℏt₁₃, ℏt₁₂) e^{−iπℏt₁₃} Φ(ℏt₂₃, ℏt₁₃) e^{−iπℏt₂₃} Φ(ℏt₁₂, ℏt₂₃) = e^{−iπℏT}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.BlockResidues.pentagon_blocks","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.BlockResidues.pentagon_blocks","kind":"theorem","line":238,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/BlockResidues.lean#L238-L249","doc":"**The pentagon for every four-block partition of `V^{⊗N}`**, `ℏ` transcendental:\n`Φ^{234} Φ^{1,23,4} Φ^{123} = Φ^{1,2,34} Φ^{12,3,4}` with `t_{ab} = ℏ t_{X_a, X_b}`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.BlockResidues.nr1323","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.BlockResidues.nr1323","kind":"theorem","line":235,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/BlockResidues.lean#L235-L236","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.BlockResidues.nr2324","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.BlockResidues.nr2324","kind":"theorem","line":233,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/fo